      "source": "Interface for the cluster commands supported by Redis executed using reactive infrastructure. A\n<a href=\"RedisClusterNode.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisClusterNode</code></a> can be obtained from <a href=\"#clusterGetNodes()\"><code>clusterGetNodes()</code></a> or it can be constructed using either\n<a href=\"RedisNode.html#getHost()\"><code>host</code></a> and <a href=\"RedisNode.html#getPort()\"><code>RedisNode.getPort()</code></a> or the <a href=\"RedisNode.html#getId()\"><code>node Id</code></a>.",
      "translation": "这是用于执行通过响应式基础设施支持的 Redis 集群命令的接口。可以通过<a href=\"RedisClusterNode.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisClusterNode</code></a>获取节点，该节点可从<a href=\"#clusterGetNodes()\"><code>clusterGetNodes()</code></a>方法获得；或者使用<a href=\"RedisNode.html#getHost()\"><code>host</code></a>和<a href=\"RedisNode.html#getPort()\"><code>RedisNode.getPort()</code></a>，或<a href=\"RedisNode.html#getId()\"><code>node Id</code></a>来构造该节点。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>node</code> - must contain <a href=\"RedisNode.html#getHost()\"><code>host</code></a> and <a href=\"RedisNode.html#getPort()\"><code>RedisNode.getPort()</code></a> and must\n         not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>node</code> - 必须包含<a href=\"RedisNode.html#getHost()\"><code>host</code></a>和<a href=\"RedisNode.html#getPort()\"><code>RedisNode.getPort()</code></a>，且不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
